    "decision_needed": "REBUILD_PLAN.md section 4 requires the new schema to carry an explicit ordering signal for same-day races (e.g. a required 'heat/round sequence' or full timestamp instead of only a date) so PR/SB attribution no longer depends on insertion order. This is a behavior CHANGE from the old app, made deliberately \u2014 call it out in the Phase 2 PR."
